Z||000004||fierospeeder||03-09-2000||12:49 PM||||sometimes i have cops let me pass them on the highway, or ill let them have the right of way and im just follwing them.  I noticed some troppers or sheriffs speed and ill just follow behind them until they get off the exit ramp.  <P>Two days ago i was going 20 over in the town where al copone lived, bad town, but i saw a car on the side street thinking oh shoot a cop, it was an unmarked cop car with two cops in bullet proof vests that didn't do anything and went through a red light, i guess they had to do something.||||reg||1
